---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Contact Us" description="Get in touch with the My Fortune team.">
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>
  <p class="updated">We'd genuinely like to hear from you</p>

  <p>
    My Fortune doesn't run a backend server, so there's no contact form submitting to a
    database here — instead, the fastest way to reach us is directly by email.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="123akashsingh639@gmail.com">hello@myfortune.example</a>
    <br />
    <span style="font-size:12px; color:#6b6880;">(Replace this with your real support email before launch.)</span>
  </p>

  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Which game you were using (e.g. "Palm Reader" or "The Scrying Pool")</li>
    <li>What device and browser you're on, if you're reporting a bug</li>
    <li>A screenshot, if it's a visual issue</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Found a bug?</h2>
  <p>
    We'd rather hear about it than not. Every game on this site is actively maintained, and
    real reports genuinely help.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
